  (text "B5 — DIGITAL I/O AND TIMING: 8 x 5 V TTL outputs, 2 fast outputs, bidirectional TRIG (panel SMA), 10 MHz TCXO option" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 14 0) (effects (font (size 3 3) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4b9fc567-6c5f-5d35-9e8c-7ec348f1ed61"))
  (text "74AHCT541 (TTL-compatible inputs accept 3.3 V) buffers DIO1..8 to 5 V; 1 k series per output limits a shorted output to 5 mA (students!). Outputs are static/slow (kHz): 1 k x 100 pF cable = 100 ns." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 19 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "991cafc6-2f14-5424-b65a-96df7689c16c"))
  (text "v0.7: DIO1..8 keep their names but are no longer MCU pins — they come from the TCA9535 I2C expander U505 (address 0x20, A0 = A1 = A2 = GND), P00..P07. The 541 runs at +5V_RAW while the expander drives 3.3 V: the AHCT TTL thresholds (VIH 2.0 V) accept that. P10..P13 = RLY_IN1..4 (relay gates, B4), P14..P17 = spare on test points EXP_P14..P17." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 22.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1ad87cfe-138f-5712-9847-b7ac5474003a"))
  (text "74HCT125: FAST_OUT1/2 (MCPWM/RMT) -> 49.9 R series -> terminals; drive +-6 mA rated, so a 50 R termination gives ~1 V: fast outs are for high-impedance TTL loads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2df5315a-6c83-5dad-a7b4-076bd45f7452"))
  (text "TRIG: 74LVC1T45 A = TRIG_IO (3.3 V), B = 5 V side -> 33 R -> TRIG_5V -> panel SMA; DIR (GPIO39) 1 = output. Into a 50 R termination ~2.4 V typ (beyond the rated 32 mA), 5 V into high-Z. BAV99 clamps B to GND/+5V_RAW." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 28.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "51c1dde3-d297-5321-b04a-1b6457bc4f54"))
  (text "TCXO option (all DNP): clipped-sine 10 MHz -> 1 nF -> Schmitt buffer biased at VCC/2 -> 74LVC1G17 -> JP501 -> GPIO44 (open JP2 on the base sheet when used). VCONT at 1.65 V from a divider." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.7 31.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e89057b8-337b-5b2e-9090-0975e2a6eebb"))
  (text "J501-J504: TTL1..TTL8 (5 V TTL out, 1 k series); J505: GND GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1502aa62-3eb4-5017-96fe-1cdac0cedae1"))
  (text "J506/J507: FASTTTL1/2 + GND (5 V TTL, 49.9 R series)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 250 125 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bb59c3fa-3133-5a84-9635-54a77f2f8826"))
  (text "TRIG_DIR = 1: TRIG_IO drives the SMA (output); 0: SMA -> TRIG_IO (input, 5 V tolerant)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 240 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "83039226-4772-5d32-9178-3531e393d132"))
  (text "10 MHz timebase option — all parts DNP by default (zero cost); JP501 open until a firmware use exists" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 268 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0de3393f-9a2e-54eb-81b6-c9a075a25306"))
  (text "U505 TCA9535 (TSSOP-24, address 0x20, A0 = A1 = A2 = GND): the I2C port expander that replaced 12 direct GPIO in v0.7 —" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 197 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "92be4130-f203-5ae7-86d1-70dfd57a773a"))
  (text "P00..P07 = DIO1..8 into the 74AHCT541 above, P10..P13 = RLY_IN1..4 to the relay gates (B4), P14..P17 spare on TP501..TP504." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 200.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "5aa1165b-bbc8-5e18-a61a-32e4e25b4d39"))
  (text "Every port is an input after power-up and after a reset: the relay gate pull-downs (B4) are what set the safe state." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 204 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9534503d-e1e2-55b5-a061-f3b442a70bcd"))
